2026-08-22 15:00:42 [INFO] [sqlalchemy.engine.Engine] [req:cf92d944-e89c-4c49-85fd-5ba66b28a104] SELECT vault.is_deleted, vault.deleted_at, vault.created_at, vault.updated_at, vault.number, vault.bottle_caps, vault.happiness, vault.power, vault.power_max, vault.food, vault.food_max, vault.water, vault.water_max, vault.population_max, vault.radio_mode, vault.id, vault.user_id
